assessing IT/Cyber risks, Federal Reserve examiners assess each firm's:

 Board and senior management for effective oversight and support of IT management; 
 Information/cyber <span class="match">security</span> program for strong board and senior management support, integration of <span class="match">security</span> activities and controls through business processes, and establishment of clear accountability for <span class="match">security</span> responsibilities; 
 IT operations for sufficient personnel, system capacity and availability, and storage capacity adequacy to achieve strategic objectives and appropriate solutions;
